# EVO IT Tools

Internal IT tools and scripts for Elevate Entertainment Group Mac deployments.

---

## New Mac Setup

After enrolling the Mac in Apple Business, run this command in Terminal to install Datto RMM:

curl -L -o /tmp/DattoRMM.pkg "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JaDoShaJu/evo-it-tools/main/DattoRMM-EVO-v5.pkg" && sudo installer -pkg /tmp/DattoRMM.pkg -target / && rm /tmp/DattoRMM.pkg

```bash
curl -o /tmp/Agent.zip "https://zinfandel.rmm.datto.com/download-agent/mac/66293e47-c134-49d2-861f-3fb35be697df" && unzip /tmp/Agent.zip -d /tmp/DattoInstall && sudo installer -pkg /tmp/DattoInstall/AgentSetup/CAG.pkg -target /
```

Once Datto installs, the following will deploy automatically via Datto RMM:
- Microsoft 365 (Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Teams, Outlook)
- Local admin account (evoadmin)
- VPN profile (already deployed via Apple Business)

